{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T09:10:59.527Z","data":{"text":"Done.\n\nImplemented task 3 in `src/state/deployments.ts` and added `tests/state-deployments.test.ts`.\n\n- **`createDeployment`** validates the app exists and the image, inserts a `pending` deployment with `null` container/error/finish and records the initial status event.\n- **`setDeploymentStatus`** records every change with the clock time (including repeats), carries the container id forward, stores `error`, sets `finishedAt` on `failed`/`stopped`/`replaced`, and refuses changes to finished deployments with `DeploymentFinishedError`.\n- **`getDeployment`**, **`latestDeployment`**, **`deploymentHistory`** (optional `limit`) and **`deploymentStatusChanges`** use `seq` for creation order rather than timestamps; unknown app/deployment ids raise the typed errors.\n- Verified: task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/state-deployments.test.ts` (11 pass) and proposal `pnpm verify` (91 pass, typecheck clean).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/003-app-state/.run/results/3.md`."}}
